{"item_uid": "指考補93-physics-005", "sitting": "makeup", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 93, "year_ce": 2004, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 5, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "某輛救護車的警報器發出頻率為 1600Hz 的聲音。當此車以 20m/s 的速率正對著站\n立在路旁的某人接近時，此人所聽到聲音的頻率為何？ （假設聲速為 340m/s）", "options": {"A": "1750 Hz", "B": "1700 Hz", "C": "1650 Hz", "D": "1600 Hz", "E": "1550 Hz"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
